BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:So Fetch Halloween Soirée
DTSTART:20261031T000000
DTEND:20261031T000000
DTSTAMP:20261031T163846Z
UID:fa081f8cebd6cbdd34127758e59b85@events-near-me
DESCRIPTION:Get ready for a spooky night full of fun vibes and killer cost
 umes at the ultimate Halloween bash! This Halloween\, The Street Bar at Ro
 chambeau is serving a little Parisian mischief with a side of Plastics ene
 rgy. 💋🥂 Slip into something très chic and join us for a late-night 
 Halloween fête featuring a live DJ\, specialty themed cocktails\, moody v
 ibes\, and just the right amount of bad behavior. Dress to impress - $100 
 gift card for the winning costume! Expect French flair\, flirty pours\, an
 d a few cheeky nods to your favorite Mean Girls moments — all with that 
 signature Rochambeau polish. Bring your besties\, dress to be seen\, and p
