SUMMARY:Whose Live Anyway?
DTSTART:20261031T000000
DTEND:20261031T000000
DTSTAMP:20261031T163846Z
UID:de058ec9a0e0773851d1df30fba001@events-near-me
DESCRIPTION:Get ready for a night of fast paced\, laugh out loud improv wi
 th Whose Live Anyway? a high energy comedy experience where everything is 
 made up on the spot and the audience is part of the fun. Featuring cast me
 mbers Ryan Stiles\, Greg Proops\, Jeff B. Davis and Joel Murray\, this all
  star lineup brings razor sharp wit\, quick thinking and undeniable chemis
 try to the stage as they create scenes\, characters\, songs and outrageous
  moments right before your eyes. Built entirely on audience suggestions\, 
 no two shows are ever the same. From clever one liners and hilarious games
  made famous on the long running TV show to brand new surprises\, the perf
 ormance is a nonstop ride of spontaneous comedy. With musical direction by
  Laura Hall\, even the songs are improvised and impressively so. Audience 
 participation is key\, so come ready with ideas. You might even find yours
 elf invited onstage. While the show is open to all ages\, please note that
  some PG 13 language may be used. Don’t miss this unforgettable night of
  unscripted comedy where anything can happen and usually does. Sources: Di
 scover Central Massachusetts Event page: https://www.discovercentralma.org
 /event/whose-live-anyway%3f/29983/\n\nEvents Near Me: within 30 miles of N
 orthborough\, MA 01532\nDiscovery: Local fallback from massachusetts-event
 s.ics\nSource page: https://www.discovercentralma.org/event/whose-live-any
 way%3f/29983/
LOCATION:The Hanover Theatre and Conservatory for the Performing Arts\, 2 
 Southbridge St.\, Worcester\, MA\, 01608
URL:https://www.discovercentralma.org/event/whose-live-anyway%3f/29983/
END:VEVENT
