BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Race in the Machine: The Making of Algorithmic Bias
DTSTART:20261104T000000
DTEND:20261104T000000
DTSTAMP:20261031T163846Z
UID:9e5954a65eb7b869c35a7b24a3604c@events-near-me
DESCRIPTION:Though many of us may think of race as a social construct\, ex
 actly how race has been (and continues to be) constructed is often unclear
 \, with deadly consequences. This panel discussion brings together scholar
 s who investigate how racial categories are hidden in numerous technologie
 s central to modern life—clinical algorithms\, internet search engines\,
  computer vision\, and artificial intelligence. Working both within and be
 yond academia\, these scholars investigate how race becomes embedded in te
 chnological systems and the harms that result. How can we better understan
 d the idea of race through its relationship with technology\, and how migh
 t we begin to untangle these systems to promote justice? Following the pro
 gram\, attendees will have the opportunity to view the new exhibition Meas
 urement on the Color Line: Scientific Instruments and the Making of Human 
 Categories at the Collection of Historical Scientific Instruments Free eve
 nt parking is available with registration. Register by November 3 to recei
 ve parking registration instructions. Presented by the Collection of Histo
 rical Scientific Instruments and the Harvard Museums of Science & Culture.
  LEARN MORE Sources: Meet Boston Event page: https://www.meetboston.com/ev
 ent/race-in-the-machine%3a-the-making-of-algorithmic-bias/93903/\n\nEvents
  Near Me: within 30 miles of Northborough\, MA 01532\nDiscovery: Local fal
 lback from massachusetts-events.ics\nSource page: https://www.meetboston.c
 om/event/race-in-the-machine%3a-the-making-of-algorithmic-bias/93903/
LOCATION:Zimmer Hall (formerly Science Center)\, Lecture Hall A\, Zimmer H
 all\, Lecture Hall A 1 Oxford Street\, Cambridge\, MA\, 02138
URL:https://www.meetboston.com/event/race-in-the-machine%3a-the-making-of-
 algorithmic-bias/93903/
END:VEVENT
