BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:BIG Teen Media Showcase
DTSTART:20261105T000000
DTEND:20261105T000000
DTSTAMP:20261031T163846Z
UID:d5447862d7ad91f8804af8be5af9ca@events-near-me
DESCRIPTION:The BIG Teen Media Showcase will feature a short film\, and tw
 o documentaries\, all written and produced by Brookline teens\, plus a Q&A
  with producers. As BIG Media Apprentices\, teens are hired to learn profe
 ssional media skills on the job. As short film producers\, they create a b
 udget\, write a screenplay\, and work on a professional film set. Document
 arians tell hyperlocal stories about Brookline’s cultural centers\, mom-
 and-pop businesses\, and civic driven inquiries into topics like town gove
 rnment and immigration. FEATURED FILMS Eye to Eye (Short Film) In this sho
 rt narrative film\, produced by BIG’s Cinema Apprentices\, things get ou
 t of hand when Stevie inadvertently puts a mysterious curse on her ex-boyf
 riend\, Tyler. With Tyler now a social pariah\, can his best friend\, Bric
 k\, help him lift the curse and win Stevie back? The Outdoor Adventure Clu
 b (Documentary) BIG’s award winning teen film director\, Derek Matos Hue
 rtas\, goes white water rafting with Brookline High’s Outdoor Adventure 
 Club. Through interviews with club founder Paul Epstein\, Derek explores t
 he club's evolution over the years and its impact on teens in this excitin
 g and moving documentary short. Newcomers and Neighbors: How Diversity Sha
 pes Brookline (Documentary) This short documentary explores the racial and
  immigrant identity in the town and schools of Brookline. Through intervie
 ws with local students\, administrators\, and experts\, it investigates th
 e effectiveness of support systems the town has historically offered to im
 migrants and people of color\, including the Metropolitan Council for Educ
 ational Opportunity (METCO) and newer establishments like the Asian Americ
 an Pacific Islander Leadership and Affinity Program (LEAP). LEARN MORE / G
 ET FREE TICKETS Sources: Meet Boston Event page: https://www.meetboston.co
 m/event/big-teen-media-showcase/93541/\n\nEvents Near Me: within 30 miles 
 of Northborough\, MA 01532\nDiscovery: Local fallback from massachusetts-e
 vents.ics\nSource page: https://www.meetboston.com/event/big-teen-media-sh
 owcase/93541/
LOCATION:Coolidge Corner Theater\, Coolidge Corner Theater 290 Harvard Str
 eet\, Brookline\, MA\, 02445
URL:https://www.meetboston.com/event/big-teen-media-showcase/93541/
END:VEVENT
