 library!-2026%3a-an-evening-of-authors-books-%26-community/31182/\n\nEvent
 s Near Me: within 30 miles of Northborough\, MA 01532\nDiscovery: Local fa
 llback from massachusetts-events.ics\nSource page: https://www.discovercen
 tralma.org/event/celebrate-our-library!-2026%3a-an-evening-of-authors-book
 s-%26-community/31182/
