BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Exuberant Voices with Worcester Chamber Music Society
DTSTART:20261106T000000
DTEND:20261106T000000
DTSTAMP:20261031T163846Z
UID:d67061d637a4fccf4a27abbe4389ad@events-near-me
DESCRIPTION:Enjoy a musical evening of world-class chamber music at the Ic
 on Museum and Study Center with a special concert performed by Worcester C
 hamber Music Society musicians Krista Buckland Reisner (violin)\, Mark Ber
 ger (viola)\, Joshua Gordon (cello)\, and Randall Hodgkinson (piano). Mart
 inů’s Three Madrigals are a complex blend of the English madrigals and 
 energetic Bohemian and Moravian folk music that he loved. Beethoven’s ce
 llo sonata\, written after a three-year hiatus from composition\, marked a
  radical stylistic departure from his earlier works and ushered in his lat
 e style. Saint- Saëns’ quartet is rhythmically dynamic\, jaunty in tone
 \, energetic\, and exuberant. Sources: Discover Central Massachusetts Even
 t page: https://www.discovercentralma.org/event/exuberant-voices-with-worc
 ester-chamber-music-society/30651/\n\nEvents Near Me: within 30 miles of N
 orthborough\, MA 01532\nDiscovery: Local fallback from massachusetts-event
 s.ics\nSource page: https://www.discovercentralma.org/event/exuberant-voic
 es-with-worcester-chamber-music-society/30651/
LOCATION:The Icon Museum and Study Center\, 203 Union St.\, Clinton\, MA\,
  01510
URL:https://www.discovercentralma.org/event/exuberant-voices-with-worceste
 r-chamber-music-society/30651/
END:VEVENT
