BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Worcester Chamber Music Society Concert: Exuberant Voices - Clinto
 n
DTSTART:20261106T000000
DTEND:20261106T000000
DTSTAMP:20261031T163846Z
UID:9f0e4edb142b6123acfc6bfc255ab5@events-near-me
DESCRIPTION:Exuberant Voices Martinů’s Three Madrigals are a complex bl
 end of the English madrigals and energetic Bohemian and Moravian folk musi
 c that he loved. Beethoven’s Cello Sonata \, written after a three-year 
 hiatus from composition\, marked a radical stylistic departure from his ea
 rlier works and ushered in his late style. Saint- Saëns’ Quartet is rhy
 thmically dynamic\, jaunty in tone\, energetic\, and exuberant. Friday\, N
 ovember 6 @7:00 PM The Icon Museum and Study Center 203 Union Street\, Cli
 nton pre-concert talk @6:30 PM Program Bohuslav Martinů: Three Madrigals
 \, H.313 Ludwig van Beethoven: Cello Sonata in D Major\, Op. 102 No. 2 Cam
 ille Saint-Saëns: Piano Quartet in B-Flat Major\, Op. 41 venue is handica
 pped accessible Sources: Discover Central Massachusetts Event page: https:
 //www.discovercentralma.org/event/worcester-chamber-music-society-concert%
 3a-exuberant-voices-clinton/30760/\n\nEvents Near Me: within 30 miles of N
 orthborough\, MA 01532\nDiscovery: Local fallback from massachusetts-event
 s.ics\nSource page: https://www.discovercentralma.org/event/worcester-cham
 ber-music-society-concert%3a-exuberant-voices-clinton/30760/
