BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Assumptionist Charism on Campus & in the World: A Conversation
  with Father Peter Precourt\, AA
DTSTART:20261120T150000
DTEND:20261120T163000
DTSTAMP:20261031T163846Z
UID:7bb0ec7d31114d6d5615c598f50ce8@events-near-me
DESCRIPTION:Join us for “The Assumptionist Charism on Campus & in the Wo
 rld: A Conversation with Father Peter Precourt\, AA” on Friday\, Novembe
 r 20\, from 3:00 p.m. to 4:30 p.m. in the Chapel of the Holy Spirit. As Fr
